{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1190302-mission-to-mars","id":1190302,"title":"Mission to Mars","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-02-28T09:19:59-08:00","id":1190302,"title":"Mission to Mars","content":"Mission to Mars<br /> <br /> * Setting - Present day Aeon Core. <br /> <br /> * Powers - At base Talents, though other types of Inspired might show up. (For example of we unlock Superiors then they might be available to play.)<br /> <br /> * Premise - Exploration snd colonization of Mars, boosted b the signs of flux. <br /> <br /> Intro:<br /> <br /> A quick idea I had while watching the Trinity Kickstarter. It came to me after Troy Lenze mentioned flux and thus my eyes opened to thr possibilitie of making Mars more then simply Mars.<br /> <br /> Background: <br /> <br /> So scientists on Earth begin noticing that something odd is going on at Mars. This includes getting weird images from the probe on Mars - canals which weren't actually there before now are is one such newly seen element. <br /> <br /> With government funding tight the international Aeon Society came forward saying it would finance a mission to the world, though it did have some requirements. The government's accepted and so the Ares Mission was conceived. It would seek to establish some orbital infrastructure to build a ship to take a crew to Mars to establish a permanent outpost. <br /> <br /> Obviously forces on Earth try to stop it, led by beings who don't want the mystery getting out. During this attempt certain secrets of Earth are revealed. <br /> <br /> Still despite some issues Aeon gets it's space construction dock built, and maybe a space elevator as well. From that a ship is built and launched to Mars. <br /> <br /> Even more once on Mars many sites of flux are found, which lead to the appearance of zones from nearby parallel dimensions intruding on this one. At the heart of said intrusions is an ancient mysterious man made but not man made ziggurat. It's up to the heroes to decide what to do with the site, with their choices effecting all of Earth. <br /> <br /> Once on Mars some of the explorers who were baseline awaken as Inspired with the potential to be more. This is directky related, as figured out, due to the flux fields saturating the world. <br /> <br /> Note: <br /> <br /> Ideas and thoughts are very welcome!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":661,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","user":"LordHeru","date":". 03-01-2018, 05:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-01T14:11:34-08:00","id":1190786,"title":"","content":"So upon thought maybe this isn't a mission to Mars but rather humanity's first attempt at interstellar exploration and colonization. <br /> <br /> The start is when scientistsfrom numerous observatories notice something odd coming from a far off system. Using state of the art systems they determine thete is a planet there with something artificial. Its at this point Aeon Foundation comes forward and says we can help, trust us. So with funding new scientific discoveries are made, technologies created, orbital infrastructure built, and a primitive jump ship built. Maybe this is designed by Talents, who already exist, using their Inspired science abilities. <br /> <br /> Maybe at some point a flight explodes, sending telluric energy sound the globe, enough to lead to the other low level Inspired. <br /> <br /> Eventually enough successes are achieved that a man mission to the stars is finally planned. Using the Inspired tech starship with jump engine a dozen or so people head to the world where the signals are detected. <br /> <br /> Having to deal with living and building on a new world could be fun, as well as dealing with native fauna and flora, and the mysteries of the alien ruins. <br /> <br /> I could also see events happening that lead to a growing number of awakening - be it of Psiads, Psions, Novas, or the three Inspired. <br /> <br /> I can also see the potential of events going on at Earth that effect what is on the new world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}